#: ../../source/api/advanced/disjoint.rst:9 fbd5c38dad864540a9dcdd131054e719
msgid ""
"The Disjoint Set (also known as Union-Find) is a data structure that "
"efficiently tracks partitions of elements into disjoint sets, supporting "
"fast union and connectivity queries."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api/advanced/disjoint.rst:15 43888a05d76643c297a9f263c3156a42
msgid "Contents"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api/advanced/disjoint.rst:18 0d0b3af0190446458dc556d562148027
msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api/advanced/disjoint.rst:20 ab05e6bdad54488c8c55cf084d75fcfc
msgid ""
"The Disjoint Set maintains a forest of trees where each tree represents a"
" distinct set. With path compression and union by rank optimizations, "
"operations achieve nearly constant amortized time complexity."
msgstr ""

